{"title":"The Knicks Starting Five Painted on One Dollar Bills","link":"https://kottke.org/26/06/the-knicks-starting-five-painted-on-one-dollar-bills","date":1781533320000,"content":"\n         \t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532482-d55c95d3.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532482-d55c95d3.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532482-d55c95d3.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Artist Claire Salvo has painted the starting five of the world champion NY Knicks on a set of US one dollar bills. If you’re in NYC, you may have seen these cheekily <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DY-PcukETHd\">pasted up</a> <a href=\"https://blog.josephholmes.io/thank-you-clairesalvo-17693\">around the city</a>.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532443-3d2a2192.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532443-3d2a2192.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532443-3d2a2192.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>She’s <a href=\"https://www.clairesalvo.com/dollarbillprints/starting-five\">selling a print of all five bills</a> but is also <a href=\"https://startingfive.indy.auction/auctions/6a246cba8171cf1ad9338dad\">auctioning off the hand-painted originals</a>. The auction ends in a bit more than 4 days and the top bid currently stands at $3200.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532521-81bc1799.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532521-81bc1799.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532521-81bc1799.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532528-30f52aa8.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532528-30f52aa8.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1781532528-30f52aa8.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>See also: <a href=\"https://kottke.org/18/09/the-harriet-tubman-20-stamp\">The Harriet Tubman $20 Stamp</a> and a discussion of whether such modification of US currency is legal or not.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Claire%20Salvo\">Claire Salvo</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/NY%20Knicks\">NY Knicks</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sports\">sports</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"c7cca3328c56d1e5d23169889d25ab08f1cdd4cb8bdfd4443ff642d4bb728e79","category":"Sites"}